## 14. Data model (Prisma)

This is the Phase 1 core, with notes where later phases attach. It is a starting schema for engineering to review, not a final one.

Rules that apply to every model:

- Every business-owned table has `businessId`, indexed.
- Money fields are `BigInt` in kobo. Serialise them as strings in JSON.
- History tables (`ActivityEvent`, `Payment`) are append-only.
- Times are stored in UTC.

