**Reasons for the main choices**

| Choice | Reason |
| --- | --- |
| Stages and fields stored as rows | Phase 2 changes workflows without a data migration. |
| `OrderItem.measurementSnapshot` | Past orders keep the measurements they were made with. |
| `Task.payKobo` copied at approval | A later rate change never rewrites past pay. |
| `TaskAssignment` as its own table | One assignee now, many later, with a full history. |
| `Payment.providerRef` unique | A repeated provider webhook cannot record twice. |
| `Invoice.revision` | A sent invoice is locked; changes create a new revision. |
| `Customer` unique on business and phone | Customers belong to one business; the phone format allows matching later. |

